Description: Companion package for 'Mass Spectrometry Data Analysis with R:
    A Practical Guide to Reproducible Proteomics and Metabolomics with Bioconductor'.
    Provides unified workflows, quality-control metrics, metabolite annotation
    helpers, protein inference algorithms, missingness diagnostics, statistical
    modeling wrappers, and journal-compliant scientific visualizations (AI4SciFig)
    for mass spectrometry research.
